## Dependency Order

```
Week 1: Upload → Viewer (no storage needed, just temp files)
Week 2: Database → Canvas drawing (need to save regions)
Week 3: OCR → Backend processing (needs regions from Week 2)
Week 4: Text extraction → Alternative input method (parallel to Week 3)
Week 5: Queue system → Batch processing (needs Weeks 1-3)
Week 6: Templates → Automation (needs Week 5)
Week 7: Export → Output (needs all previous)
```

